/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (KPI cards summarise key figures, charts show the distribution of participants by type and by track, and the report options menu offers several formats for viewing the same data. With a single selection the tabular list of registrations became a Kanban board of cards grouped by technical track, so event organisers can monitor registrations and spot empty tracks without exporting data to a spreadsheet or using any external software. These low-code reporting features therefore streamline event monitoring. The Zia / AI-assisted functionality was not used in the current account, so the practical work covered the built-in dashboard analytics, charts and report-view options.)
/E (KPI cards summarise key figures, charts show the distribution of participants by type and by track, and the report options menu offers several formats for viewing the same data. With a single selection the tabular list of registrations became a Kanban board of cards grouped by technical track, so event organisers can monitor registrations and spot empty tracks without exporting data to a spreadsheet or using any external software. These low-code reporting features therefore streamline event monitoring. The Zia / AI-assisted functionality was not used in the current account, so the practical work covered the built-in dashboard analytics, charts and report-view options.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19]
>>
