276 0 obj
<<
/Title (KPI cards summarise key figures, charts show the distribution of participants by type and by track, and the report options menu offers several formats for viewing the same data. With a single selection the tabular list of registrations became a Kanban board of cards grouped by technical track, so event organisers can monitor registrations and spot empty tracks without exporting data to a spreadsheet or using any external software. These low-code reporting features therefore streamline event monitoring. The Zia / AI-assisted functionality was not used in the current account, so the practical work covered the built-in dashboard analytics, charts and report-view options.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 221 0 R
/Prev 275 0 R
>>
